	(text "MSEL[2:0] = 011: AS x4 Normal (Fast mode needs all rails up within its ramp window).\nMT25QU256 as on the Trenz Agilex 3 board: CS 4.7k and DQ2/DQ3 10k pull-ups to 1.8 V.\nFlash RESET# (A4, internal pull-up) on AS_nRST (SDM_IO15): required for AS x4 (config guide 3.2.7.1).\nJTAG: J2 is 3.3 V (FTDI mini-module on flying leads), shifted to the 1.8 V SDM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
